{"id":"steam-753190","steam":753190,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Zero Symptom","summary":"The Covid vaccine has turned some of the population into monsters. Will you be able to stop the zombie apocalypse and create a new vaccine, or will you turn to the dark side in this first-person horror shooter with consequences for your choices.","about":"Zero Symptom is a first-person horror game with shooter and survival elements that tells the story of a doctor who arrives at the center of an epidemic caused by an experimental vaccine against COVID.\n\nThe game takes place around the 90s in post-Soviet Russia, in one of the many remote towns in the forgotten corners of the country.\n\nThe vaccine worked as expected for most people, but turned the rest into previously unseen creatures.\n\nThe previous doctor has stopped communicating, and you will have to learn about his actions before you, as well as clean up the consequences or worsen them with your choice.\n\nWill you be able to stop the spread of the epidemic and help everyone in need, will you be able to save seemingly hopeless patients, or will you turn the city into a hotbed of infection?\n\nThe choice is yours.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/753190/562aeaa57a98f1134a866294dd063ff88ea071f7/library_600x900.jpg?t=1792512125","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/753190/6fe5bd34131bf2e0f3665c4fef40c01a4f75776c/header.jpg?t=1792512125","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/753190/6c718616b3131f8d9b39bc849b0e93f2dfb433f8/library_hero.jpg?t=1792512125","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/753190/6fe5bd34131bf2e0f3665c4fef40c01a4f75776c/header.jpg?t=1792512125","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/753190/f7a36bfa1cbdf2423059e652bfa125e93ddc97fa/page_bg_v6.jpg?t=1792512125","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://sha